{"checkPoint": 1791892652437, "syncTaskBean": {"update": [{"id": "909348163afb2da75c567de5", "projectId": "b7bb2e24b677ff0266455e76", "sortOrder": -1099511621776, "title": "📊 看板、时间线视图：可视化管理", "content": "随心切换清单视图，让任务展示更高效。\n\n- **看板视图**：希望任务分类呈现？快使用看板视图，以卡片形式展现任务分类，分类一目了然。[💡了解看板视图](/dida-help/articles/6950656501543337984)\n\t\n- **时间线视图**：长期项目如何追踪？试试时间线视图，更直观查看任务时间、轻松拖拽随时调整计划。[💡了解时间线视图](/dida-help/articles/6950656549178048512)\n\t\n![file](/media/newuser3/desktop/cn/view.mp4)\n", "timeZone": "Asia/Shanghai", "isFloating": false, "isAllDay": true, "reminder": "", "reminders": [], "exDate": [], "priority": 0, "status": 0, "items": [], "progress": 0, "modifiedTime": "2026-10-13T09:02:13.000+0000", "etag": "x1twk9iw", "deleted": 0, "createdTime": "2026-10-13T09:02:13.000+0000", "creator": 100000001, "tags": [], "columnId": "ee815109242f2506a237b1ff", "kind": "TEXT", "taskType": 1}, {"id": "4f159184d1a37afcd31edf71", "projectId": "b7bb2e24b677ff0266455e76", "sortOrder": -1099511625776, "title": "📅 日历：日程安排一目了然", "content": "时间管理的关键，不仅在于提醒备忘，更在于有一个好的规划。我们为你提供了多种日历视图，方便你更好地安排日程。\n\n![file](/media/newuser3/desktop/cn/calendar.mp4)\n", "timeZone": "Asia/Shanghai", "isFloating": false, "reminder": "", "reminders": [], "repeatFlag": "", "exDate": [], "priority": 0, "status": 0, "items": [], "progress": 0, "modifiedTime": "2026-10-13T09:02:13.000+0000", "etag": "pj8l8zg0", "deleted": 0, "createdTime": "2026-10-13T09:02:13.000+0000", "creator": 100000001, "tags": [], "columnId": "a84a7a86c8d35f4fc09d95ef", "kind": "TEXT", "taskType": 1}, {"id": "9bd4b2daa4705998d9d15ee7", "projectId": "b7bb2e24b677ff0266455e76", "sortOrder": -1099511624776, "title": "🎯 四象限：提升效率利器", "content": "如果你每天有很多事情要做，使用四象限功能，可以帮助你聚焦重要且紧急的工作。\n\n![file](/media/newuser3/desktop/cn/matrix.mp4)\n", "timeZone": "Asia/Shanghai", "isFloating": false, "reminder": "", "reminders": [], "repeatFlag": "", "exDate": [], "priority": 0, "status": 0, "items": [], "progress": 0, "modifiedTime": "2026-10-13T09:02:13.000+0000", "etag": "o2qki577", "deleted": 0, "createdTime": "2026-10-13T09:02:13.000+0000", "creator": 100000001, "tags": [], "columnId": "a84a7a86c8d35f4fc09d95ef", "kind": "TEXT", "taskType": 1}, {"id": "a103549eae278e73812ef182", "projectId": "b7bb2e24b677ff0266455e76", "sortOrder": -1099511623776, "title": "🍅 番茄专注：拯救拖延症", "content": "如果你有拖延症，不妨试试番茄工作法，用完成一个个番茄钟积累的成就感，帮助你达成更多目标。\n\n![file](/media/newuser3/desktop/cn/pomodoro.mp4)\n", "timeZone": "Asia/Shanghai", "isFloating": false, "reminder": "", "reminders": [], "repeatFlag": "", "exDate": [], "priority": 0, "status": 0, "items": [], "progress": 0, "modifiedTime": "2026-10-13T09:02:13.000+0000", "etag": "sytzkbwh", "deleted": 0, "createdTime": "2026-10-13T09:02:13.000+0000", "creator": 100000001, "tags": [], "columnId": "a84a7a86c8d35f4fc09d95ef", "kind": "TEXT", "taskType": 1}, {"id": "b1c16c5dd3be6cfcc9655091", "projectId": "b7bb2e24b677ff0266455e76", "sortOrder": -1099511622776, "title": "⏰ 习惯打卡：见证坚持与成长", "content": "想要培养好的习惯，却总是半途而废？不妨试试这个功能。每次的打卡记录和数据统计，会见证你的坚持与成长。\n\n![file](/media/newuser3/desktop/cn/habit.mp4)\n", "timeZone": "Asia/Shanghai", "isFloating": false, "reminder": "", "reminders": [], "repeatFlag": "", "exDate": [], "priority": 0, "status": 0, "items": [], "progress": 0, "modifiedTime": "2026-10-13T09:02:13.000+0000", "etag": "r8osuch0", "deleted": 0, "createdTime": "2026-10-13T09:02:13.000+0000", "creator": 100000001, "tags": [], "columnId": "a84a7a86c8d35f4fc09d95ef", "kind": "TEXT", "taskType": 1}, {"id": "1e7a2f5d58060c80e83f1230", "projectId": "b7bb2e24b677ff0266455e76", "sortOrder": -1099511620776, "title": "🔗 订阅日历：不再错过重要日程", "content": "还在频繁的切换其他日历应用查看日程？试试订阅日历功能，可轻松订阅Google、Outlook、Exchange、iCloud等日历。\n\n[💡如何订阅日历](/dida-help/articles/6950000554735042560)\n\n![file](/media/newuser3/desktop/cn/subscription.mp4)\n", "timeZone": "Asia/Shanghai", "isFloating": false, "isAllDay": true, "reminder": "", "reminders": [], "exDate": [], "priority": 0, "status": 0, "items": [], "progress": 0, "modifiedTime": "2026-10-13T09:02:13.000+0000", "etag": "wrzveywi", "deleted": 0, "createdTime": "2026-10-13T09:02:13.000+0000", "creator": 100000001, "tags": [], "columnId": "ee815109242f2506a237b1ff", "kind": "TEXT", "taskType": 1}, {"id": "fca4d97abd2690b35d16e083", "projectId": "b7bb2e24b677ff0266455e76", "sortOrder": -1099511627776, "title": "✅ 点击输入框，创建任务", "content": "如果你经常忘记要做的事情，不妨将这些事情记录下来，设置提醒，解放你的大脑。\n\n![file](/media/newuser3/desktop/cn/task.mp4)\n", "timeZone": "Asia/Shanghai", "isFloating": false, "reminder": "", "reminders": [], "repeatFlag": "", "exDate": [], "priority": 0, "status": 0, "items": [], "progress": 0, "modifiedTime": "2026-10-13T09:02:13.000+0000", "etag": "40vt6p64", "deleted": 0, "createdTime": "2026-10-13T09:02:13.000+0000", "creator": 100000001, "tags": [], "columnId": "4a065b06b33039c496c0f119", "kind": "TEXT", "taskType": 1}, {"id": "036717220cc44c00cab3690f", "projectId": "b7bb2e24b677ff0266455e76", "sortOrder": -1099511626776, "title": "📋 用清单来管理任务", "content": "当任务越来越多时，你可以使用清单来分类管理任务。\n\n- **收集箱**：临时的想法和事情都可以记录在这里。\n- **智能清单**：有时间的任务将智能显示在“今天、最近 7 天”清单中，哪天需要做什么一目了然。\n- **清单**：你还可以添加清单来管理任务，如工作、生活等。\n\t\n[💡了解更多清单内容](/dida-help/articles/6950654234933067776)\n\t\n![file](/media/newuser3/desktop/cn/list.mp4)\n", "timeZone": "Asia/Shanghai", "isFloating": false, "reminder": "", "reminders": [], "repeatFlag": "", "exDate": [], "priority": 0, "status": 0, "items": [], "progress": 0, "modifiedTime": "2026-10-13T09:02:13.000+0000", "etag": "3nwll0h7", "deleted": 0, "createdTime": "2026-10-13T09:02:13.000+0000", "creator": 100000001, "tags": [], "columnId": "4a065b06b33039c496c0f119", "kind": "TEXT", "taskType": 1}, {"id": "e778eecc52add3badbea1b98", "projectId": "b7bb2e24b677ff0266455e76", "sortOrder": -1099511619776, "title": "✨更多特色功能", "content": "我们还有这些特色功能：\n\n- **全平台支持**：不管是手机、电脑，还是手表，几乎所有用得到的设备和操作系统都支持。[👀 看看支持哪些平台](/dida-help/articles/6950366447398813696)\n\n- **共享协作**：项目需要和同事一起完成？快邀请他们加入你的清单，轻松指派任务给成员。[🤝 如何共享清单](/dida-help/articles/6950649257581871104)\n\n- **标签**：想要个性化管理任务？试试给任务添加标签，轻松分类和筛选任务，管理更便捷。[🏷️ 如何使用标签](/dida-help/articles/6950656299306582016)\n\n- **过滤器**：需要查看所有高优先级的任务？试试过滤器功能，随心所欲筛选你想看的任务。[🚀 如何使用过滤器](/dida-help/articles/6950655961044353024)\n\n- **摘要**：还在为复盘内容苦思冥想？试试摘要功能，轻松掌握一段时间内的任务完成情况。 [📋 如何使用摘要](/dida-help/articles/6950671600370843648#摘要)\n\t\n- **指令菜单**：想快速前往功能模块，直接使用指令菜单（Ctrl/Command+K），轻松前往。[⌨️ 了解更多快捷操作](/dida-help/articles/6950372467189743616)\n\n", "timeZone": "Asia/Shanghai", "isFloating": false, "reminder": "", "reminders": [], "repeatFlag": "", "exDate": [], "priority": 0, "status": 0, "items": [], "progress": 0, "modifiedTime": "2026-10-13T09:02:13.000+0000", "etag": "uf3qszcu", "deleted": 0, "createdTime": "2026-10-13T09:02:13.000+0000", "creator": 100000001, "tags": [], "columnId": "ee815109242f2506a237b1ff", "kind": "TEXT", "taskType": 1}, {"id": "0d9e84e42ca3aa36208b7b36", "projectId": "b7bb2e24b677ff0266455e76", "sortOrder": -1099511618776, "title": "💎 高级会员", "content": "在所有平台上享有20项高级功能、10倍清单和任务数量，助你实现更多目标和可能。\n\n[✌️了解高级会员功能](https://dida365.com/payment?from=welcome)\n", "timeZone": "Asia/Shanghai", "isFloating": false, "reminder": "", "reminders": [], "repeatFlag": "", "exDate": [], "priority": 0, "status": 0, "items": [], "progress": 0, "modifiedTime": "2026-10-13T09:02:13.000+0000", "etag": "95en9er2", "deleted": 0, "createdTime": "2026-10-13T09:02:13.000+0000", "creator": 100000001, "tags": [], "columnId": "ee815109242f2506a237b1ff", "kind": "TEXT", "taskType": 1}, {"id": "d6113334fc7d73c9560812a4", "projectId": "b7bb2e24b677ff0266455e76", "sortOrder": -1099511617776, "title": "💡 帮助中心", "content": "在帮助中心，你可以更全面地了解滴答清单，学习时间管理方法。如果有任何的建议和疑问，也可以直接联系我们。\n\n你也可以在社交媒体上关注我们，获取最新动态和更多使用技巧。\n* 微信公众号：滴答清单\n* 小红书：[滴答清单](https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/7f18ebbdd7d7880d0257fc03?xhsshare=CopyLink&appuid=b722cebb3bcd8fb1258b3377&apptime=1680746095)\n* 微博：[滴答清单](https://weibo.com/u/3495327284)\n\n[🤝去帮助中心瞧一瞧](/dida-help)\n", "timeZone": "Asia/Shanghai", "isFloating": false, "re